3. Does capacity follow cores?
==============================================================
machine   : Intel(R) Xeon(R) Platinum 8124M CPU @ 3.00GHz
topology  : 4 physical cores x 2 threads
affinity  : servers 2,6,3,7, generator 1,5
reserved  : 0,4 left to the kernel -- see lib.sh for why
load      : wrk -t4 -c100 -d10s, 5 reps, median
